cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this repository, please cite it as below, together with the
  accompanying paper.
title: >-
  Spanish-Enigma: A research toolkit for the cryptanalysis of Spanish
  Enigma K traffic (1936–1945)
abstract: >-
  Data and software for reading the commercial Enigma K traffic of the
  rebel forces in the Spanish Civil War: transcriptions of intercepts with
  their archival provenance, rotor wirings and the stepping with their
  sources, an Enigma K engine, an exhaustive key search (rod test and a
  language score for Spanish), Knox's buttoning-up for rotor wirings, and
  the keys and readings it has produced, with the tests that check them.
type: software
